# LibreEcho Linux upstream audit inventory.
#
# This is an audit marker only. Renovate must not be treated as permission to
# merge upstream stable kernel changes into the LibreEcho hardware tree.
# Updates are held in the Dependency Dashboard until explicitly approved and
# still require a deliberate stable-kernel integration, conflict review, full
# ARM32 build/regression checks, and hardware acceptance where relevant.
#
# Current source Makefile baseline: Linux 6.1.178.
# renovate: datasource=github-tags depName=gregkh/linux versioning=loose
LINUX_STABLE_VERSION=v6.1.178
